 'up':'<path d="m7 14 5-5 5 5"/>','down':'<path d="m7 10 5 5 5-5"/>','trash':'<path d="M3 6h18M8 6V4h8v2m3 0-1 14H6L5 6M10 10v6M14 10v6"/>',
